{
  "borough": "Hounslow",
  "application_type": "All Other",
  "decision": "Refused",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The property is not located in an area with good access to public transport (at least PTAL 4), nor within convenient walking distance of town centre facilities, and would therefore be unacceptable in principle, contrary to Local Plan policy SC10 and the Council's Houses in Multiple Occupation SPD.",
    "Reason : 2 - The proposal would, due to the size of bedroom 5, fail to provide an acceptable standard of accommodation, contrary to Local Plan Policy SC5, the Nationally Described Space Standards (NDSS), and the Council's Houses in Multiple Occupation SPD.",
    "Reason : 3 - The proposal would, due to the increased comings and goings, noise and disturbance, and the lack of information to demonstrate otherwise, would harm the living conditions of neighbouring properties, contrary to Local Plan Policy CC2, SC10 and the Council's Houses in Multiple Occupation SPG.",
    "Reason : 4 - The proposal would, due to not being located in an area with good access to public transport (at least PTAL 4) and in the absence of a parking survey, lead to increased demand for car parking on surrounding streets, harmful to the safety and free flow of the local highway network, contrary to Local Plan policy EC2."
  ],
